+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account timeline: cards being added, assigned, moved, renamed,
+closed, or commented on.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity on the boards you have access to, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the user who performed the activity |
+
+The following `action` values are returned:
+
+| Action | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_published` | A card was added |
+| `card_assigned` | A card was assigned to one or more users |
+| `card_unassigned` | A card was unassigned from one or more users |
+| `card_closed` | A card was moved to "Done" |
+| `card_reopened` | A card was reopened |
+| `card_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" |
+| `card_auto_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" due to inactivity |
+| `card_triaged` | A card was moved from "Maybe?" into a column |
+| `card_sent_back_to_triage` | A card was moved back to "Maybe?" |
+| `card_board_changed` | A card was moved to another board |
+| `card_title_changed` | A card was renamed |
+| `comment_created` | A comment was posted on a card |
+
+Each activity includes a plain-text `description`, the `eventable` record it concerns (a card or a comment),
+and `particulars` with details specific to the action:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+| All other actions | `{}` |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+The `url` opens the card. For `comment_created` activities, it opens the card and jumps to the comment.
+
